{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00046",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 6.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.96,
      "end_seconds": 12.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.17,
      "end_seconds": 26.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "Mainly pressure in the face. There's a couple of other things, you know, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.05,
      "end_seconds": 30.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.7,
      "end_seconds": 46.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.31,
      "end_seconds": 53.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.32,
      "end_seconds": 63.5,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "So, I notice it more with bending forward. I get some relief from steam. Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.53,
      "end_seconds": 69.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Alright, any a headache over your forehead as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.01,
      "end_seconds": 72.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.11,
      "end_seconds": 94.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Is there anything medical in your background?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.69,
      "end_seconds": 99.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I've had eczema for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.19,
      "end_seconds": 108.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Right, so eczema is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.88,
      "end_seconds": 113.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I've never been told I have allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.59,
      "end_seconds": 114.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.95,
      "end_seconds": 120.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.37,
      "end_seconds": 124.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Tell me what you take day to day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.99,
      "end_seconds": 130.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Oh, I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.22,
      "end_seconds": 133.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.09,
      "end_seconds": 139.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "For about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.18,
      "end_seconds": 141.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Alright, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.46,
      "end_seconds": 144.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.66,
      "end_seconds": 148.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.41,
      "end_seconds": 154.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.59,
      "end_seconds": 157.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.48,
      "end_seconds": 161.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.75,
      "end_seconds": 165.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Who do you live with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.87,
      "end_seconds": 170.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "I live with my family, my husband and two kids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.26,
      "end_seconds": 177.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Have you noticed nosebleeds, stiff neck, ear pain or swelling around the eyes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.08,
      "end_seconds": 183.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Uh, none, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.04,
      "end_seconds": 186.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.3,
      "end_seconds": 189.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.08,
      "end_seconds": 193.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.66,
      "end_seconds": 198.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Hmm, no, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.86,
      "end_seconds": 219.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.27,
      "end_seconds": 233.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Rest your hand here..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.0,
      "end_seconds": 260.71,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, heart rate 69, blood pressure 126 over 77. And temperature 36.9, respiratory rate 14."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.27,
      "end_seconds": 263.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.99,
      "end_seconds": 269.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Don't worry, I'll go through it in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.93,
      "end_seconds": 274.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Shall we do the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.59,
      "end_seconds": 277.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.66,
      "end_seconds": 297.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "There's tenderness when I press over the cheeks and above the eyebrows."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.33,
      "end_seconds": 300.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Right, almost done with this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.03,
      "end_seconds": 320.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "The nose is congested with swollen lining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.8,
      "end_seconds": 330.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.0,
      "end_seconds": 346.03,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "Good, that's the examination. Okay, so my impression is this: I'd lean towards sinusitis. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.63,
      "end_seconds": 350.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Is this something I'll have for good?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.67,
      "end_seconds": 382.65,
      "duration_seconds": 30.98,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now sinusitis is my leading thought, not anything worse. I think an X-ray of the sinuses makes sense here, for sinusitis. I'm going to put you on saline nasal spray, three times a day, for one week. That should help with nasal congestion. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Steam a couple of times a day and saline rinses will help clear things."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.6,
      "end_seconds": 392.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.36,
      "end_seconds": 397.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Alright, uh, I know what to look for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.53,
      "end_seconds": 401.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I'll want another look in ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.09,
      "end_seconds": 407.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Alright, you know, I'll put it in my diary."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.78,
      "end_seconds": 412.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "That's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.66,
      "end_seconds": 419.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Um, I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}